.TH WB2API 1 "2026-10-24" "workbuddy2api-panel" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wb2api, signin, login, credit \- WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy OpenAI-compatible API gateway and helpers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wb2api
.RB [ -config
.IR path ]
.br
.B signin
.RI ...
.br
.B login
.RI ...
.br
.B credit
.RB [ -pretty | -json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wb2api
is the main multi-account gateway server. It exposes an OpenAI-compatible API
(\\fB/v1/chat/completions\\fR) backed by WorkBuddy/CodeBuddy accounts, plus a
web management panel (default \\fBhttp://127.0.0.1:7863/panel/\\fR).
Use \\fB-config\\fR to specify a JSON configuration file (default \\fBconfig.json\\fR).
.PP
.B signin
is the single-account sign-in utility.
.PP
.B login
runs the WorkBuddy device OAuth login flow and stores credentials under \\fIauths/\\fR.
.PP
.B credit
prints a daily credits report for configured accounts.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I config.json
Runtime configuration (listen address, API key, auth dir, schedule, etc.).
.TP
.I auths/
Per-account credential JSON files.
.TP
.I data/state.json
Persisted pool state.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project repository: https://github.com/LeisureLinux/workbuddy2api-panel
